  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Nizamuddin vs State Of U.P. And Another on 5 February, 2024 High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc:19312 Court No. - 92 Case :- Application U/S 482 No. - 1136 of 2024 Applicant :- Nizamuddin Opposite Party :- State of U.P. and Another Counsel for Applicant :- Jai Prakash Singh,Raj Kiran Chaudhary Counsel for Opposite Party :- G.A. Hon'ble Prashant Kumar, J.",
    "facts": "2. The present application under Section 482 Cr.P.C. has been filed by the applicant praying for quashing charge sheet dated order dated 21-09-2023 as well as entire proceedings of Sessions Trial No. 551 of 2023 (State Vs. Nizamuddin) arising out of case crime no.228 of 2020, under Sections 188, 269, 270, 273 IPC, 31(1) 63 of Food Safety and Standards Authority, 2006 and 3 of the Epidemic Diseases Act, 1897, P.S. Mugalsarai, district Chandauli.",
    "arguments": "4. Per contra, learned A.G.A. submits that the applicant had earlier filed an application U/S 482 No. 38424 of 2022, challenging the charge-sheet along with the cognizance order, which has been rejected by this Court vide order dated 28-02-2023 and for the same cause of action he is again filing the instant application. He further submits that the matter is under trial for evidence and no interference is required by this Court in the impugned order as well as the on going proceedings."
  },
